  "user_request_original": "Design an aperiodic multilayer dielectric stack with air incidence on fused silica substrate. Stack: 12 alternating pairs of HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) (24 layers total), starting with HfO2. Each of the 24 layers has an independently optimizable physical thickness. Optimize all 24 thicknesses simultaneously to maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band while maximizing reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Layer count fixed at 24. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Lemarchand).",
